{"screen_name": "kepi_63", "first_seen": "2025-10-10T10:57:41.308872+00:00", "last_updated": "2025-10-10T10:57:41.308872+00:00", "profile": {"id": 254708, "acceptable": true, "creator": true, "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951275297963384832/YMn8O0Q_.png", "name": "けぴ", "nsfw_acceptable": true, "screen_name": "kepi_63", "language": "ja", "body_size": 10000, "received_works_count": 120, "received_nsfw_works_count": 23, "appeal_receivable": false, "sent_first_works_count": 0, "sent_public_works_count": 0, "instruction": "unspecified", "description": "成人済／同人アカウント●イラストレーター:商業依頼やご連絡はこちらへ→@Rkp_63 ●Skeb https://skeb.jp/@kepi_63 ●Do not reupload and use my art", "busy": false, "url": "https://potofu.me/kepi", "show_social_profile": true, "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "received_requests_average_response_time": null, "completing_average_time": null, "nc": 32, "twitter_uid": "241374875", "user_service_link": [], "banned": false, "banned_by": "", "complete_rate": 1, "og_image_url": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fskeb.jp%2Fapi%2Fusers%2Fkepi_63%2Fbackground%3Fd%3Df1dae3?blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9hc3NldHMuaW1naXgubmV0L350ZXh0P3R4dDY0PVVrVkRUMDFOUlU1RVJVUWdVRkpKUTBVJnR4dGNscj1mZmYmdHh0Zm9udDY0PVFYWmxibWx5TFUxbFpHbDFiUSZ0eHRhbGlnbj1jZW50ZXImdHh0c2l6ZT00MCZ0eHRzaGFkPTEwJmZtPXBuZyZ3PTEyMDA&bm=normal&by=360&mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9hc3NldHMuaW1naXgubmV0L350ZXh0P3R4dDY0PU1Ua3NNREF3SUVwUVdRJnR4dGNscj1mZmYmdHh0Zm9udDY0PVFYWmxibWx5TFVKc1lXTnImdHh0YWxpZ249Y2VudGVyJnR4dHNpemU9ODAmdHh0c2hhZD0xMCZmbT1wbmcmdz0xMjAw&marky=415&txt64=44GR44G0&txtclr=fff&txtfont64=QXZlbmlyLUJsYWNr&txtfit=max&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=60&txtshad=10&auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=1200&h=630&s=3b1c796987e5de83d1eeafa4db8aad4a", "skills": [{"genre": "art", "default_amount": 19000}, {"genre": "correction", "default_amount": 10000}], "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@kepi_63/works/121", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3206537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1491d3ce/uploads/origins/ea0e1f94-84ab-460c-9bdb-4c51c2b558f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d30b189f187679da6a844aa90196fa6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1491d3ce/uploads/origins/ea0e1f94-84ab-460c-9bdb-4c51c2b558f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=97bf69395e106af837898869b1784f6a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n礼装「黒の聖杯」の衣装を身に着けたカリオストロ伯爵を描いていただきたいと考えております。胸元には通常の聖杯を挟む形でお願いできればと思います（？）\nいつもご協力いただき、本当にありがとうございます！", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/120", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3206537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5285c527/uploads/origins/59edda0c-6d87-45b8-9c6f-5c3747abb9af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37fb2c9d415fc610f783e8ca27cdc214", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5285c527/uploads/origins/59edda0c-6d87-45b8-9c6f-5c3747abb9af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ad2fd4af8e9c757821f0e948b4b2d020", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I was wondering if I could commission you to draw the secretary Count Cagliostro (wearing Koyanskaya of Dark’s secretary outfit? I’m really looking forward to seeing Cagliostro with black stockings and thighs).\nIn the background, could you include a “shocked” or “space cat” expression Mochi-style U-Olga Marie?\nThank you so much!\n\nこんにちは！もし可能でしたら、秘書伯爵（闇のコヤンスカヤの秘書服を着せた感じ？黒いストッキングの太ももがとても楽しみです）を描いていただけませんか。\n背景には「驚き」や「宇宙猫」状態のもち風Ｕ－オルガマリーを入れていただけると嬉しいです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/119", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 2688313, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0274061/uploads/origins/addffdd7-8cfa-4c1f-9386-3d559e96dbe0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b616f2ad0475973b0d602a2619168da", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0274061/uploads/origins/addffdd7-8cfa-4c1f-9386-3d559e96dbe0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4c0ce0f823555c4cf15b3446ce91feb3", "src_set": ""}, "body": "イチャイチャな術ギルぐだください", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/118", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3206537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4442db3/uploads/origins/21eae4b4-2f68-4853-b21a-d0f39c502886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c64d85aeb4a9631661ca4bcb5f1a0775", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4442db3/uploads/origins/21eae4b4-2f68-4853-b21a-d0f39c502886?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bb6cc5d03d6473b19010d5f6c5d40930", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I’d love to request an illustration of Count Cagliostro (FGO) wearing a courtesan (oiran) style outfit.\nFor the costume design and colors, please use inspiration from Cagliostro’s 3rd Ascension outfit.\nThank you so much for your time!\nいつも素敵な作品ありがとうございます！\n\nカリオストロ伯爵のイラストをリクエストしたいです。\n花魁風の衣装を着た伯爵が見たいです！\n衣装のデザインは、カリオストロの第三再臨の衣装と配色を参考にしていただければ嬉しいです。\n\nご検討いただきありがとうございます！", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/117", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1a2905e/uploads/origins/b9605c9f-752d-4e42-99d6-fc8ff7c780a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9a8c5cdf25f73354dc4e73bf8b838f8a", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 2688313, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/116", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 2688313, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3d53f835/uploads/origins/cf89e9e3-d182-4a53-98db-c14651dbca36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d16d100616c6491772529b53a1178574", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3d53f835/uploads/origins/cf89e9e3-d182-4a53-98db-c14651dbca36?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e81c7fd6191b0e032ed66437e17b8ae6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ナルトのかっこいいおじサスケをください", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/115", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 2688313, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/27667611/uploads/origins/75fd19dc-27ed-4178-a7a3-9a40ec509b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01d4cd9cfb158f880eaa0635f2c4fbe2", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/27667611/uploads/origins/75fd19dc-27ed-4178-a7a3-9a40ec509b15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6ec92fc4560aed4e8e211bcb5baf7eed", "src_set": ""}, "body": "最高にかっこいい子ギルくんください", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/114", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 543492, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/19410625/uploads/origins/aa9b2780-f7ca-4a3f-b95d-7fcfc88391e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f1e3d2bd18f6f261a7ced8cab6065c9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/19410625/uploads/origins/aa9b2780-f7ca-4a3f-b95d-7fcfc88391e6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=035da4c882f5ae9dca5f6c8c74314c92", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして！あなたのアートに出会って、その色彩とダイナミックさがとても気に入りました。\n\n私のキャラクター、アウレリオ（https://photos.app.goo.gl/nMsfi39cwsTjAm718）のアートをお願いしたいです。\n\nセイバー・ネロ・ブライド(https://photos.app.goo.gl/1TS4sCTP2QXCES46A)(https://photos.app.goo.gl/UppRpPgmQmu24M157)の衣装を着てほしいです。\n\nポーズはこれに近いものがいいと思います(https://photos.app.goo.gl/jTBCRwtJd1JKY96JA)。アウレリオは錠前と鎖を持っていて、それを装着することができる。\n\nアウレリオはツンデレ王子系キャラなので、顔は高慢だけど照れくさそうで、赤面していると思います。\n\nリクエストを読んでくださってありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/nMsfi39cwsTjAm718", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/113", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc765bb7/uploads/origins/712375b7-bbc7-4fc6-a490-1ff77139ee4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=76a01b6c31ccc8111c664d130711ec28", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3483580, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/112", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/89a19383/uploads/origins/39859c3a-2452-4370-a2de-c7bc11b6a945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8807b26993bf667b8f8f8f1daab30336", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/89a19383/uploads/origins/39859c3a-2452-4370-a2de-c7bc11b6a945?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9e1363957c8526f68ebeedef326a8122", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風がとても好きです。fate samurai remnantの宮本伊織を描いていただけませんか？バニー服を着てほしいです。構図やポーズは自由です。ありがとうございました！", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/111", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3206537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ca12a44/uploads/origins/a14e9b72-0fce-4e8b-8fa3-48781931fe35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cdb663fac74b8f1fd9f1127dfe5cd97", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ca12a44/uploads/origins/a14e9b72-0fce-4e8b-8fa3-48781931fe35?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1ae8215371572bd3472219539f03d64", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\nもし可能であれば、今回は「ハロウィン・プリンセス」の概念礼装を着たカリオストロ伯爵を描いていただけないでしょうか？衣装の配色は、伯爵のカラーに合わせて（たとえば全体をグレー系に）変更していただけると嬉しいです。\nいつも素晴らしい作品をありがとうございます！どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/110", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 2310845, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/230b0008/uploads/origins/e010a25e-e849-4e04-b372-a64b09f82534?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6f5c1dfefe2fb7ed07fe0fdff30145a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/230b0008/uploads/origins/e010a25e-e849-4e04-b372-a64b09f82534?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c98c7cc3bdd0a6854f1747ff930f2b00", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの画風がとても気に入ったので、オリジナルのキャラクターを描いてもらえないかと思っていました。\n僕の友人をモデルにしたキャラクターなんだけど、以前にも描いてくれたことがあるんだ。僕のキャラクターは、彼女とは正反対に描いてほしいんだ。黒と赤ではなく、白と青で。\n\n彼女のキャラクターはこんな感じです： https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GPW7wKj75_eOlgCov66nbiEDnCaX9TAF/view?usp=drive_link\n\n私のキャラクターは、紫ではなく青と白のカラーリングで、似たような感じにしたいです。https://imgur.com/a/eyrnHeN\n\n私のキャラクターは、かなり背の低い雪狼の男の子にしたいです。彼は18歳ですが、小さくて女性らしく見えます。白い柔肌で、瞳孔の開いたスカイブルーの目をしている。\n真っ白なショートヘアで、頭頂部には白い狼の耳があります。狼の耳は、私の友人の参考にしたように、内側にスカイブルーの炎があるものにしてほしいです。(https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MB4W0BK7egzH0guBZseFlp-WxnOJE4Ds/view?usp=drive_link)\n(https://imgur.com/a/toTs56L)彼の腕には長すぎる袖の大きな白いセーターを着てほしいです。\n白の長いハイソックスを履かせてください。\n最後に、私の友人の参考資料のように、先端にスカイブルーの炎がついた、巨大なふわふわの白いオオカミの尻尾を1本だけ彼につけていただけませんか？巨大な尻尾は1本だけにしてください。\nキュートで生意気な表情をしていれば、どんなポーズでも構いません！背景もシンプルでいいです。\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RRChkKJTFgNjxehNVJ_JI036s98oWYqT?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/109", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 847373, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4b4cd29/uploads/origins/4d79f4fa-77f2-4f51-9cea-8376486d7208?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b26e3c9ededb0a3ad9a251c325b45d68", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4b4cd29/uploads/origins/4d79f4fa-77f2-4f51-9cea-8376486d7208?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7050060f99f73446e25106e1a6cb86ca", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、お元気ですか？\n\n月姫の翡翠を描いてください。\n\nできれば2枚描いてください。\n\n1) いつものメイド服。\n2) その他、お好きな衣装\n\n構図やポーズは自由です。つまり、好きなように描いてください。あなたの解釈を見てみたい。ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/re9v7DP", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kepi_63/works/108", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 254708, "client_id": 3206537, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f214913/uploads/origins/417fe82f-9643-4148-89b8-09a1d353f727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb45d88be7550db65bed94f17b07b805", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f214913/uploads/origins/417fe82f-9643-4148-89b8-09a1d353f727?bg=%23fff&auto=for